invalid type: string "/**\n * severityEngine.js\n *\n * Takes AI-flagged issues (which already carry an AI-suggested severity)\n * and applies a DETERMINISTIC re-ranking layer on top. The AI's severity\n * is treated as one input signal, not the final word.\n *\n * Score factors:\n *  - Category base weight (security/bug > naming/style)\n *  - AI confidence\ngroupKey).push(issue);\n  }\n\nÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ